== kp_p --pmodel cyl:7x6
[kpsolve cyl:7x6 ep=on cap=1: 10 layers, 35280 states, depth 5, 0.0s]
# P5 bare, Z_72 = Kc4 Pb5 kb6 pc5
Kc4 Pb5 kb6 pc5 w - | D D | Kc4c3:D Kc4d5:L Kc4d3:D Kc4b3:D
Kc4 Pb5 kb6 pc5 b - | W W | Kb6a5:W
# the four White sorties, Black to move
Kb3 Pb5 kb6 pc5 b - | D D | Kb6b5:D Kb6a5:W Pc5c4:W Pc5c3:D
Kc3 Pb5 kb6 pc5 b - | D D | Kb6b5:D Kb6a5:W Pc5c4:W
Kd3 Pb5 kb6 pc5 b - | D D | Kb6b5:D Kb6a5:W Pc5c4:W Pc5c3:D
Kd5 Pb5 kb6 pc5 b - | L L | Kb6b5:L Kb6a5:W Pc5c4:W Pc5c3:L
# after ...Kxb5 (White to move)
Kb3 kb5 pc5 w - | D D | Kb3b2:L Kb3c3:D Kb3a3:L Kb3c2:L Kb3a2:L
Kc3 kb5 pc5 w - | D D | Kc3c2:L Kc3d3:L Kc3b3:D Kc3d2:L Kc3b2:L
Kd3 kb5 pc5 w - | D D | Kd3d2:L Kd3e3:L Kd3c3:D Kd3e4:L Kd3e2:L Kd3c2:L
Kd5 kb5 pc5 w - | L L | Kd5d6:L Kd5e5:L Kd5e6:L Kd5e4:L
# after ...Ka5 Kc4 (Black to move)
Kc4 Pb5 ka5 pc5 b - | D D | Ka5a4:W Ka5g5:W Ka5b6:D Ka5g6:W Ka5g4:W
# Kd5 line: ...c3 double step
Kd5 Pb5 kb6 pc3 w c4 | L L | Kd5d6:L Kd5d4:L Kd5e5:L Kd5e6:L Kd5e4:L Kd5c4:L
